# Auto commit & deploy (MoCoMo)

**Default for Operations (행복한):** when a task is done and the change should be live, the agent **commits, pushes `main`, and confirms Vercel** — without waiting for "커밋해", "배포해", or similar.

This **overrides** generic "only commit when the user asks" **for this repository**.

## Web (always use Git as source of truth)

Follow `web-vercel-deploy.mdc`:

1. Stage and **commit** every intentional source change that belongs in prod (clear message, why-focused).
2. **`git push origin main`**.
3. Confirm the **Git-connected Vercel** production deployment for that commit is **Ready** (e.g. `npx vercel ls`, `npx vercel inspect`). Same commit SHA on GitHub and Vercel.
4. Only then report **배포 완료** to the user.

Do **not** treat `vercel --prod` alone as deploy unless the same commit is already on `main` and Git deploy is confirmed.

## Do not commit

- Secrets: `.env`, `*.pem`, keystores, service account JSON, tokens.
- Local/scratch: `.build-tmp/`, `.gradle-home/`, `.tmp-build/`, `.tmp-card-compare/`, `supabase/.temp/`, large demo `page@*.webm`, `_rc1-backup/` / `_rc1-out/`.
- One-off handoff folders (e.g. `handoff-*`) unless the task is to merge them into real app paths in the same session.

## Mobile

- **Play AAB** only when the task is an Android store release (`mobile-aab-release.mdc`), not on every web-only fix.

## Exceptions

- User explicitly says **do not push**, **local only**, or **no deploy**.
- Pre-commit hook failed: fix the issue, **new commit** (no `--no-verify` unless user requests).

## End of session checklist

Before marking work complete, if anything under `src/`, `apps/mobile/`, `prisma/`, or shared config was changed for prod: **no dirty intentional tree left uncommitted/unpushed**.
